{"id": "34419", "title": "狂狮的呛辣新娘", "author": "辰晞", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34419.htm", "intro": "这个男人真是多管闲事！想她可是堂堂的宗岩门堂主，身手可好了，哪需要他来“出手相助”啊！她本来想要亲自动手修理这些家伙的，被他这么一搅和，她打发时间的玩具没了，恩哼，那她只好拿他来出气了——真气人！她不但连碰都碰不到这个男人，反而还被他制得死死的，最最可恶的是……他竟然还偷吻了她！？这下，她非宰了这个家伙不可！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34419", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2185082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2185083.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185085.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185087.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2185106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2185107.html"